    work: "Professionally, Neptune's doubled emphasis suits creative and caring work: music, film, writing, photography, art therapy, social work, counselling, charity and spiritual roles. They tend to bring intuition and imagination to everything they do. Highly structured, competitive environments may drain them. They often need flexibility, quiet and a sense of meaning to thrive. Practical support, such as clear deadlines, reliable tools or an organised colleague, can help their gifts flourish. When they find work that honours their sensitivity, they often produce deeply moving results that touch people on an emotional level.",
    growth: "Growth for this decan often involves building gentle structures. Simple routines, such as consistent sleep, regular meals and a short daily plan, can support rather than restrict their creativity. Recognising escapist habits, and replacing some with creative outlets, tends to help. Practising small boundaries, like declining a request or limiting time with draining people, protects their compassion. Grounding activities, such as walking, swimming or gardening, can bring them back into their bodies. Their imagination and empathy are rare gifts. With a little structure, those gifts can shine without overwhelming the person who carries them.",
